{"title":"Fifteenth Meetup: Security Without the State – Police, Courts & the Free Market","startsAt":"2026-10-22T19:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-22T22:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Join Liberty Labs Toronto for our fifteenth meetup on **Thursday, October 22, 2026, at 7:00 PM** near Yonge and Eglinton!\n*(Note: this is one week later than our usual mid-month date.)*\n\nThis month we’re asking a hard question with an open mind: if there were no monopoly on force, what would protection and justice actually look like?\nWe’ll discuss:\n\n* How private security, insurance, and competing protection agencies might work in practice\n* How courts and dispute resolution could function without a state monopoly (arbitration, reputation, restitution)\n* Historical and real-world examples of non-state order\n* Common objections: “who watches the watchers?”, the poor, violent crime, and “what if the biggest gang wins?”\n* The difference between anarchic chaos and a market for law and security\n\nCome ready to think out loud. You don’t have to already believe a free-market justice system would work — you just have to be willing to examine the idea honestly.\nWhat to expect:\n\n* Open, respectful discussion (bring questions, doubts, and examples)\n* Complimentary appetizers\n* Everyone who attends will receive a million-dollar Zimbabwe note as a fun take-home reminder of real value vs. fiat illusions\n* Connect with 10-20 liberty-minded Torontonians\n\nVenue: Pickle Barrel (2300 Yonge St, at Yonge & Eglinton), right above Eglinton Station. Easy parking in the Yonge Eglinton Centre garage or nearby Green P lots.\nRSVP on Meetup or Eventbrite to save your spot.\n\nLeave the official script at the door. Let’s talk about justice and security as voluntary services — together.","venue":{"name":"Pickle Barrel","address":"2300 Yonge St, Toronto, ON M4P 1E4, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.707235,"lng":-79.398952,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Liberty Labs Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/6/5/highres_528122661.jpeg"}